### Register a product exit/delivery
POST http://localhost:8080/salidas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idEmpleado": 1,
  "NroBoleta": "BOL-001",
  "comentarios": "Entrega a cliente corporativo",
  "productosList": [
    {
      "CodigoSku": "SKU123",
      "cantidad": 5
    }
  ]
}

### Get all exits/deliveries
GET http://localhost:8080/salidas
